  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Environmental management support through policy, planning and research.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To address the barriers of technical, scientific and evidence gaps that constrain the capacity of Small Island Developing States (SIDS) to deliver marine environmental management. Support under this component will be demand led &#x2013; the programme will respond to specific requests by SIDS governments or regional bodies.</narrative>
  </description>
